HST Office: thin hooks of the ribbon customization and the recently used tab (code in hst/, hst-ribbon-custom.patch).

- SfxNotebookBar::StateMethod: hst::ribbon::lo::Attach once the notebookbar is built and before it is shown, so the
  customization is applied before the first layout (PriorityMergedHBox keeps the order of its first layout).
- SfxDispatchController_Impl::dispatch: hst::ribbon::lo::RecordCommand (in memory, written in batches).
- NotebookbarTabControl::PreNotify: "Tùy chỉnh ribbon…" on a right-click on the ribbon outside a command;
  HstQuickAccess::ContextMenu: the same item under Add to/Remove from Quick Access Toolbar.
- Build: module hst, sfx links hst_ribbon_core and the adapter objects, the dialog's .ui, the service in
  sfx.component, the Vietnamese strings in translations/source/vi/sfx2/messages.po.

